<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A12" title="In Valid Stopping for LLM Generation via Empirical Dynamic Formal Lift" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">L </span>Error Categorization</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A13" title="In Valid Stopping for LLM Generation via Empirical Dynamic Formal Lift" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">M </span>Reproducibility Checklist</span></a></li>
