</figure>
<div id="A8.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Per-dataset analysis confirms consistent benefits of default inflation across diverse domains, with all datasets achieving empirical risk below the 0.1 target when inflation is applied, compared to systematic violations without inflation. The effectiveness proves particularly pronounced for challenging datasets like ASQA and LegalBench, where complex reasoning patterns benefit most from conservative parameter estimation.</p>
</div>
