<div id="A8.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p4.1" class="ltx_p">These results demonstrate that default inflation provides robust risk control across all datasets, with empirical risk consistently below target levels compared to systematic violations without inflation.</p>
</div>
</section>
