</span></div>
</figure>
<div id="A9.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The gate reduces the HighLift+Incorrect rate by 41% (from 18.5% to 10.9%) with modest TPCA increase (+7.1 tokens) and overhead growth (+4%, Table <a href="#A9.T17" title="Table 17 ‣ Appendix I Expanded Experimental Results ‣ Valid Stopping for LLM Generation via Empirical Dynamic Formal Lift" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>), narrowing the sufficiency–correctness gap while preserving anytime-valid guarantees. The 83% verification reduction is computed as follows: the gate successfully validates 83% of EDFL stopping decisions (Table <a href="#A9.T17" title="Table 17 ‣ Appendix I Expanded Experimental Results ‣ Valid Stopping for LLM Generation via Empirical Dynamic Formal Lift" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>), requiring full verification only for the 17% of stops that fail the gate plus any sequences that continue past EDFL’s threshold.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A9.T17" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 17: </span>Hybrid gate effect (GSM8K + HotpotQA + ASQA, <math id="A9.T17.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=500</annotation></semantics></math> each, <math id="A9.T17.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta=0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta=0.1</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption>
<div id="A9.T17.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:169.1pt;height:22.4pt;vertical-align:-10.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-146.9pt,19.4pt) scale(0.365246577873287,0.365246577873287) ;">
<table id="A9.T17.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A9.T17.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A9.T17.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A9.T17.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Setting</span></th>
<td id="A9.T17.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A9.T17.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Acc</span></td>
